      <text><![CDATA[<p>Find the function \(f(x)\) given that \(\displaystyle \frac{dy}{dx}={@constant@}\)</p><p><p>\(\displaystyle f(x)=\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text>
